# Destination rules that share an FlClash policy group, independent of GEOIP.
#
# Format: domain-suffix,<domain>,<group>
# Groups: 北美 | 游戏 | 全球直连 | 18 | missav | 安全浏览 | 漏网之鱼 | DIRECT | PROXY | REJECT
#
# Source: docs/nekobox-route-snapshot.json
#   18 / missav stay as their own groups (do not merge into 北美 or 游戏).
#   安全浏览 is vivo's browser CRP host.

domain-suffix,18comic.vip,18
domain-suffix,hanime1.me,18
domain-suffix,missav.ai,missav
domain-suffix,missav.ws,missav
domain-suffix,browsercrp.vivo.com.cn,安全浏览
